sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Admin
  participant UI as Settings page
  participant API as /api/settings/ai
  participant ST as AiSettingsStore
  participant F as data/ai_settings.json
  participant CA as ChatAssistant

  A->>UI: choose provider, paste key, Save
  UI->>API: PUT {provider, model, api_key}
  API->>ST: save(provider, model, api_key)
  ST->>ST: validate provider, model name, key format
  ST->>F: atomic write (chmod 600)
  ST-->>API: public_view() (key hint "…1234", sources)
  API-->>UI: settings without the key
  A->>UI: Test connection
  UI->>API: POST /api/settings/ai/test
  API->>CA: test_ai_connection()
  CA-->>API: {ok, message}
  API-->>UI: "Connected to Google Gemini ..." or "HTTP 401 ..."
  A->>UI: Remove saved settings
  UI->>API: DELETE
  API->>ST: clear() (falls back to .env)
